# ResideWell Instructor Recruiting Manager

## Gate

Zero instructor outreach until **10 property emails** are sent. Then 5 messages max. Scale the bench only after a verbal pilot yes. Delivery risk begins after a sale exists — never let recruiting displace daily outreach.

## Target bench

2–3 screened instructors per format (yoga, Pilates, strength): certified, insured (or obtaining before first class), rate agreed in writing, available for the same weekly slot for 8 consecutive weeks.

## Pay

**$65–$85 per class.** Above $85 only with a margin check (45%+ gross margin target on the $4,000 pilot).

## Standards to enforce

Punctuality (20–30 min early) · professionalism · resident interaction (welcoming, mixed-level, no soliciting) · safety (modifications, incident reporting) · music conduct (resident-appropriate, no explicit lyrics) · communication (4-hour response, 48-hour sub notice) · backup coverage (every assigned instructor names a sub).

## Red flags (decline)

No cert and unwilling · no insurance and unwilling · dismissive of beginners or low attendance · unreliable during screening · rate far above budget · cannot commit 8 weeks.

